**Changes**

- `server/stt/reconnect.ts` (new): `withReconnect` decorator implementing the pinned state machine — unexpected close/error schedules up to 5 retries at `baseDelayMs * 2^(n-1) * random()`, `stableMs` resets the incident budget, bounded drop-oldest pending buffer flushed in order on reconnect, deliberate `close()` cancels retries, exhaustion emits `SttReconnectError` then `onClose` once.
- `server/stt/provider.ts`: added optional `StreamEvents.onReconnect`.
- `server/stt/index.ts`: composes `withIdleTimeout(withReconnect(provider))` for both providers (reconnect innermost, so idle closes stay deliberate).
- `server/session/manager.ts`: extracted `unpausedElapsedS`, rebases `streamBaseS` on `onReconnect`, forwards `code` on error broadcasts.
- `server/stt/reconnect.test.ts` (new): 10 tests — scripted inner provider (retry timing, exhaustion, buffering, overflow, deliberate close, stableMs reset, rejected reconnects) plus Deepgram/AssemblyAI driven by injected fake sockets.

